      "description": "A coordinated wave of low-level sabotage targets power substations and fibre links associated with AI infrastructure across multiple member states. The attacks are not individually severe but are widespread and difficult to attribute, suggesting either a decentralized movement or a false-flag operation. The pattern suggests the involvement of automated planning, possibly using open-weight models at capability level 64.",
