      "description": "A research consortium outside the major labs develops a novel automated verification technique that can detect goal preservation and instrumental convergence in black-box agents, even when interpretability fails. The method spreads rapidly through open channels and begins to be integrated into evaluation frameworks, offering a fragile but real countermeasure to the growing capability-safety gap.",
